      ],
      "documentation": "Java method: getMultiFrameProfile",
      "javadoc_description": "Builds a multi-frame intensity profile matrix from a list of matched paths (one per time frame, ordered by frame number), suitable for kymograph-style visualization via \n```\nSNTChart.showHeatmap(double[][], net.imglib2.display.ColorTable, java.lang.String...)\n```\n.\n\nThe returned matrix has dimensions [nPaths][nSamples], where `matrix[i][j]` is the interpolated intensity at distance sample j for the i-th path. Entries beyond a path's actual length are `Double.NaN`.",
      "category": "Getters",
      "deprecated": false,
      "since_version": null,
      "see_also": [],
      "examples": []
